      "utf8": "knows. The I R S considers you to be sixty five on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563660,
    "dDurationMs": 4381,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the day before your sixty fifth birthday. That means if your birthday"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 568041,
    "dDurationMs": 4381,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is January first of twenty twenty seven, the I R S treats"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 572422,
    "dDurationMs": 4282,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you as sixty five for the entire twenty twenty six tax year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 577624,
    "dDurationMs": 4522,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You get the extra standard deduction, the senior bonus deduction, and every"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582146,
    "dDurationMs": 3821,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "other age related benefit for a full year earlier than you expected."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 586927,
    "dDurationMs": 4982,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One day can mean thousands of dollars in tax savings. Check your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 591909,
    "dDurationMs": 3461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "birth date against the I R S rules because you might already"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 595370,
    "dDurationMs": 4501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "qualify for benefits you thought were a year away. Every one of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 599871,
    "dDurationMs": 4422,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these ten things happens automatically on the I R S side but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 604293,
    "dDurationMs": 5221,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "none of the benefits are applied automatically on yours. The deductions do"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 609514,
    "dDurationMs": 4102,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not appear unless you claim them. The withholding does not stop unless"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 613616,
    "dDurationMs": 5241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you file the form. The Medicare surcharge does not get removed unless"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 618857,
    "dDurationMs": 5342,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you appeal it. The conversion window does not stay open forever. The"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 624199,
    "dDurationMs": 3101,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I R S changes how it treats you the moment you turn"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 627300,
    "dDurationMs": 4581,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sixty five. Whether those changes cost you money or save you money"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 631881,
    "dDurationMs": 4782,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "depends entirely on whether you know they happened. I will put all"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636663,
    "dDurationMs": 4761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the form numbers and links in the description below. Send this to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 641424,
    "dDurationMs": 4922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "someone who is turning sixty five or who already passed it without"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 646346,
    "dDurationMs": 5402,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "knowing any of this. A spouse, a sibling, a friend. Because the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 651748,
    "dDurationMs": 2641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I R S is not going to call them and explain what"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 654389,
    "dDurationMs": 4201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "changed. That is what this video is for. I will see you"
